      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the advice, that makes sense. i'll try to let the soil dry out more. one more thing though—you mentioned something about \"root rot\" potentially happening. is that something that's easy to spot before it's too late, or is it kind of a hidden problem that just happens suddenly?",
